      "id": "claim_615ff316109e41278732408449e5bd09",
      "statement": "numpy-financial functions support scalar, array, and decimal.Decimal inputs, enabling high-precision calculations and leveraging NumPy broadcasting for vectorized operations by using helper routines that normalize inputs to float64 arrays before delegating to the underlying C-extension.",
